288
00:13:41,600 --> 00:13:43,840
Her film company
has been in debt for a long time.

289
00:13:43,840 --> 00:13:46,070
It's been replaced
by our short drama company.

290
00:13:46,070 --> 00:13:47,270
What about Ms. Shiqi?

291
00:13:47,670 --> 00:13:48,510
