293
00:13:49,630 --> 00:13:50,790
Ran away?

294
00:13:51,670 --> 00:13:52,200
What about Zhou Ke?

295
00:13:52,200 --> 00:13:53,260
Do you know Zhou Ke?

296
00:13:54,280 --> 00:13:56,190
Zhou Ke? I don't know him.

297
00:13:58,320 --> 00:14:00,370
Girl, are you here for an interview?

298
00:14:01,060 --> 00:14:02,920
Where is the film set around here?

299
00:14:03,910 --> 00:14:04,840
Everywhere in Shudian.

300
00:14:04,840 --> 00:14:06,100
Isn't it all a film set?

301
00:14:08,130 --> 00:14:10,530
Girl, are you here for an interview?

302
00:14:11,360 --> 00:14:11,840
No.

303
00:14:12,080 --> 00:14:13,090
