308
00:14:17,200 --> 00:14:18,080
No, I won't do it.

309
00:14:18,080 --> 00:14:18,720
Food and accommodation included!

310
00:14:18,720 --> 00:14:19,270
No, no, no.

311
00:14:19,270 --> 00:14:21,130
