Go put up a missing person notice.

330
00:14:49,390 --> 00:14:50,190
Leave, leave.

331
00:14:50,390 --> 00:14:51,150
No?

332
00:14:52,390 --> 00:14:54,000
Hello, do you know Zhou Ke?

333
00:14:54,080 --> 00:14:54,940
Never seen him.

334
00:14:55,480 --> 00:14:56,940
Hello, do you know Zhou Ke?

335
00:14:57,080 --> 00:14:58,010
I don't know him.

336
00:14:58,080 --> 00:14:59,200
Good! Very good! Very good!

337
00:14:59,200 --> 00:15:00,260
Do you know Zhou Ke?

338
00:15:00,360 --> 00:15:00,670
Yes.

339
00:15:01,120 --> 00:15:02,180
Do you know Zhou Ke?

340
00:15:02,220 --> 00:15:03,030
