349
00:15:15,560 --> 00:15:16,820
I'm from his hometown.

350
00:15:17,360 --> 00:15:18,490
Joker is over there.

351
00:15:18,510 --> 00:15:19,970
The one getting beaten up.

352
00:15:27,320 --> 00:15:29,360
Cut, cut, cut!

353
00:15:29,750 --> 00:15:30,600
Cut!

354
00:15:30,790 --> 00:15:31,910
Cut!

355
00:15:31,930 --> 00:15:32,990
What are you doing?

356
00:15:33,080 --> 00:15:35,200
