384
00:16:09,920 --> 00:16:10,320
Ke is here.

385
00:16:10,320 --> 00:16:12,120
Then the camera will pan over here.

386
00:16:12,120 --> 00:16:13,120
Right, like this.

387
00:16:15,670 --> 00:16:16,150
Zhen?

388
00:16:29,250 --> 00:16:33,270
