393
00:16:50,390 --> 00:16:52,670
Keep on!

394
00:16:52,670 --> 00:16:53,600
Stop yelling!

395
00:16:52,720 --> 00:16:55,430
♪ It's funny, actually ♪

396
00:16:54,320 --> 00:16:55,240
Sorry, man.

397
00:16:55,240 --> 00:16:55,670
Sorry.

398
00:16:55,860 --> 00:16:59,080
