407
00:17:25,069 --> 00:17:25,750
Here, here.

408
00:17:25,960 --> 00:17:26,690
Santa Claus.

409
00:17:26,750 --> 00:17:27,440
Here, have one.

410
00:17:27,440 --> 00:17:28,200
Here, here, here.

411
00:17:28,200 --> 00:17:28,880
Zhen's Fish Ball.

412
00:17:28,880 --> 00:17:29,750
Just a little something.

413
00:17:28,990 --> 00:17:31,420
♪ The longest dream I've ever had ♪

414
00:17:30,070 --> 00:17:31,070
Three, two, one.

415
00:17:31,440 --> 00:17:34,930
