while hiding it from the world ♪

416
00:17:31,790 --> 00:17:32,200
Wait.

417
00:17:32,880 --> 00:17:33,340
Wukong.

418
00:17:33,750 --> 00:17:34,210
Wukong!

419
00:17:35,200 --> 00:17:35,750
Time for a picture.

420
00:17:35,220 --> 00:17:39,420
♪ Sharing this secret only with myself ♪

421
00:17:36,920 --> 00:17:37,510
Can I?

422
00:17:37,510 --> 00:17:38,590
Come on, sure.

423
00:17:38,590 --> 00:17:40,240
Thank you, God of Wealth. Thank you, guys.

424
00:17:39,890 --> 00:17:42,780
♪ It's because I'm not smart ♪

425
00:17:40,240 --> 00:17:41,170
Three, two, one!

426
00:17:43,170 --> 00:17:46,620
