428
00:17:51,590 --> 00:17:52,310
Don't say that.

429
00:17:52,310 --> 00:17:53,030
I was wrong.

430
00:17:54,000 --> 00:17:56,400
♪ The longest dream I've ever had ♪

431
00:17:54,030 --> 00:17:54,510
Okay.

432
00:17:56,430 --> 00:17:59,850
