450
00:18:45,270 --> 00:18:45,790
Zhou Ke.

451
00:18:47,750 --> 00:18:49,030
The one who played the dog.

452
00:18:49,030 --> 00:18:49,960
The Howling Celestial Dog.

453
00:18:49,960 --> 00:18:50,640
Zhou.

454
00:18:51,060 --> 00:18:52,000
Well,

455
00:18:52,590 --> 00:18:54,160
I wrote a script.

456
00:18:55,110 --> 00:18:56,750
Ms. Shiqi wanted
to buy the copyright before.

457
00:18:56,750 --> 00:18:57,590
But I didn't sell it to her.

458
00:18:57,590 --> 00:18:58,920
I improved it myself.

459
00:18:58,920 --> 00:19:00,790
I want to show it to Director Bao Huang.

460
00:19:00,790 --> 00:19:02,240
But I can't reach Director Bao.

461
00:19:02,240 --> 00:19:02,770
Could you

462
00:19:03,070 --> 00:19:05,070
