463
00:19:05,830 --> 00:19:07,290
Looking for Director Bao?

464
00:19:08,110 --> 00:19:09,000
Director Bao?

465
00:19:09,680 --> 00:19:10,720
He got divorced.

466
00:19:12,130 --> 00:19:14,640
His son doesn't bring him
to the crew anymore.

467
00:19:14,640 --> 00:19:16,510
