468
00:19:18,510 --> 00:19:19,790
I am the director now.

469
00:19:22,710 --> 00:19:24,850
It's Director Liu this time.
Let me tell you.

470
00:19:24,850 --> 00:19:25,720
That's perfect.

471
00:19:25,720 --> 00:19:27,480
I won't look for Director Bao.
I'll look for you.

472
00:19:27,480 --> 00:19:28,510
Why don't you take a look at my script

473
00:19:28,510 --> 00:19:29,480
