487
00:19:51,280 --> 00:19:52,350
Including some comedies.

488
00:19:52,350 --> 00:19:53,070
Zhou Ke?

489
00:19:54,350 --> 00:19:55,210
Is that Zhou Ke?

490
00:19:55,640 --> 00:19:56,240
What is it?

491
00:19:58,290 --> 00:19:58,970
