494
00:20:09,850 --> 00:20:10,510
What? What?

495
00:20:11,310 --> 00:20:11,830
What are you doing?

496
00:20:11,830 --> 00:20:13,160
-Don't run!
-Don't run!

497
00:20:13,200 --> 00:20:13,800
Don't run!

498
00:20:14,590 --> 00:20:15,270
Don't run!

499
00:20:16,480 --> 00:20:17,540
What are you doing?

500
00:20:22,750 --> 00:20:23,750
