501
00:20:23,750 --> 00:20:25,290
Yeah, I don't think so either.

502
00:20:25,290 --> 00:20:26,240
Tell me about it.

503
00:20:29,470 --> 00:20:30,740
Sorry, really.

504
00:20:30,760 --> 00:20:31,760
I have a little...

505
00:20:32,590 --> 00:20:33,450
Director Zhou?

506
00:20:33,990 --> 00:20:34,720
Zhen Ni?

507
00:20:37,400 --> 00:20:38,330
Hello, Ms. Zhen.

508
00:20:41,310 --> 00:20:41,960
Ms. Zhen?

509
00:20:44,900 --> 00:20:45,580
Consort Li!

510
00:20:46,300 --> 00:20:48,290
For deliberately attempting
to murder the Empress,

511
