your entire family to execution!

512
00:20:50,720 --> 00:20:51,440
No!

513
00:20:53,000 --> 00:20:54,920
-Your Majesty, spare my life!
-Your Majesty, spare my life!

514
00:20:54,920 --> 00:20:56,240
-Your Majesty, spare my life!
-Your Majesty, spare my life!

515
00:20:56,240 --> 00:20:57,440
-Your Majesty, spare my life!
-Your Majesty, spare my life!

516
00:20:57,440 --> 00:20:58,680
-Your Majesty, spare my life!
-Your Majesty, spare my life!

517
00:20:58,680 --> 00:21:02,880
Your Majesty, spare my life!

518
00:21:03,210 --> 00:21:04,030
