519
00:21:04,110 --> 00:21:05,550
Okay, changing camera angles!

520
00:21:05,550 --> 00:21:07,010
Everyone can take a break!

521
00:21:11,030 --> 00:21:12,630
Your Majesty, spare my life.

522
00:21:13,590 --> 00:21:14,390
Your Majesty.

523
00:21:14,960 --> 00:21:15,790
Your Majesty, spare my life.

524
00:21:15,790 --> 00:21:17,880
You played that eunuch
really well just now.

525
00:21:17,880 --> 00:21:18,310
Thank you.

526
00:21:18,310 --> 00:21:19,030
For a moment,

527
00:21:19,030 --> 00:21:20,830
I thought you were a real eunuch.

528
00:21:22,000 --> 00:21:23,200
Thank you. Thank you.

529
00:21:23,510 --> 00:21:24,590
You were pretty good too.

530
00:21:24,590 --> 00:21:26,110
Among all the extras just now,

531
00:21:26,110 --> 00:21:27,270
