and you're a princess.

569
00:22:34,710 --> 00:22:36,970
I didn't expect your family to be so rich.

570
00:22:37,350 --> 00:22:39,240
Since you're so rich,

571
00:22:39,240 --> 00:22:40,790
why did you come to Shudian to be an extra

572
00:22:40,790 --> 00:22:41,990
and suffer like this?

573
00:22:42,160 --> 00:22:43,130
Because I like it.

574
00:22:43,130 --> 00:22:44,930
There aren't that many reasons.

575
00:22:46,160 --> 00:22:48,420
Rich people are indeed free and willful.

576
00:22:49,720 --> 00:22:50,920
You can't say that.

577
00:22:51,200 --> 00:22:53,830
Since I was a child, my sister
has had the final say in our family.

578
00:22:53,830 --> 00:22:55,830
She originally didn't want me
to be an actress.

579
00:22:55,830 --> 00:22:59,090
She wanted me to come back
and inherit the family business.

580
00:23:00,110 --> 00:23:01,240
Are you kidding?

581
00:23:02,310 --> 00:23:03,270
Sister.

582
00:23:03,310 --> 00:23:04,510
Don't call me Sister.

583
00:23:06,240 --> 00:23:07,790
What is this place?

584
00:23:09,310 --> 00:23:10,310
A film set.

585
00:23:11,270 --> 00:23:13,070
You have such a huge family business

586
00:23:13,070 --> 00:23:14,400
to inherit.

587
00:23:14,700 --> 00:23:15,750
Why do you

588
00:23:15,750 --> 00:23:17,240
insist on acting?

589
00:23:18,160 --> 00:23:19,030
I love it.

590
00:23:19,440 --> 00:23:20,030
Love it?

591
00:23:20,640 --> 00:23:22,300
Can love put food on the table?

592
00:23:23,670 --> 00:23:25,530
Well, you're always ice skating.

593
00:23:26,920 --> 00:23:29,270
Ice skating is my hobby.

594
00:23:30,440 --> 00:23:32,170
Besides, did I delay anything?

595
00:23:34,340 --> 00:23:35,200
Let me tell you,

596
00:23:35,350 --> 00:23:37,000
get up right now

597
00:23:37,350 --> 00:23:38,280
and come with me.

598
00:23:41,730 --> 00:23:43,460
Why are you still resisting me?

599
00:23:45,160 --> 00:23:46,110
I'm telling you,

600
00:23:46,240 --> 00:23:48,170
I'll cancel all your credit cards!

601
00:23:49,920 --> 00:23:51,320
Go ahead and cancel them.

602
00:23:51,670 --> 00:23:52,710
I don't believe

603
00:23:52,740 --> 00:23:53,440
that without you,

604
00:23:53,440 --> 00:23:54,640
I'll starve to death.

605
00:23:55,720 --> 00:23:57,480
You... Fine.

606
00:23:58,110 --> 00:23:58,640
Let's go.

607
00:23:58,750 --> 00:24:00,160
Let's go eat seafood.

608
00:24:06,530 --> 00:24:08,190
I would choose the second one.

609
00:24:10,750 --> 00:24:12,480
Do you remember when we were in Shudian,

610
00:24:12,480 --> 00:24:13,740
I asked you a question?

611
00:24:13,830 --> 00:24:16,160
Why have you been able
to hold on until now?

612
00:24:17,270 --> 00:24:18,960
Just hold on a little longer.

613
00:24:19,350 --> 00:24:21,210
What if it's the right thing to do?

614
00:24:24,310 --> 00:24:26,750
Later, I had no roles to play

615
00:24:27,120 --> 00:24:29,000
and felt I couldn't hold on anymore.

616
00:24:29,000 --> 00:24:31,260
I was going to compromise with my sister,

617
00:24:31,350 --> 00:24:32,410
but unexpectedly,

618
00:24:32,440 --> 00:24:34,900
you really called me
to play the female lead.

619
00:24:36,790 --> 00:24:38,590
Don't mention that movie I made.

620
00:24:38,680 --> 00:24:40,200
It was just average.

621
00:24:40,390 --> 00:24:41,650
It really wasn't good.

622
00:24:42,480 --> 00:24:43,960
But it really helped me.

623
00:24:44,120 --> 00:24:45,850
Later, my sister supported me.

624
00:24:47,750 --> 00:24:49,260
Your sister likes our movie?

625
00:24:49,260 --> 00:24:49,830
No.

626
00:24:52,070 --> 00:24:54,530
It's mainly because I
kept holding on later.

627
00:24:54,870 --> 00:24:57,480
I held on until I almost
starved to death in Shudian.

628
00:24:57,480 --> 00:24:58,600
My sister couldn't stand it anymore,

629
00:24:58,600 --> 00:25:01,000
so she invested in
this film company for me.

630
00:25:01,880 --> 00:25:02,960
So that's what happened.

631
00:25:02,960 --> 00:25:04,350
I guess it played a part.

632
00:25:05,070 --> 00:25:05,640
Great. Great.

633
00:25:05,640 --> 00:25:08,780
You have your own money.
You can play whatever role you want.

634
00:25:08,780 --> 00:25:11,060
So those men in black are your people.

635
00:25:11,080 --> 00:25:12,480
You asked them to find me?

636
00:25:13,090 --> 00:25:14,880
I just couldn't contact you.

637
00:25:16,550 --> 00:25:18,550
I've had some situations recently.

638
00:25:19,150 --> 00:25:20,480
What do you want from me?

639
00:25:21,240 --> 00:25:23,900
I watched the short film
you shot in the village.

640
00:25:24,400 --> 00:25:26,030
Are you interested
in making it into a movie?

641
00:25:26,030 --> 00:25:26,760
I'll invest.

642
00:25:31,960 --> 00:25:32,960
Can I be credited?

643
00:25:36,160 --> 00:25:37,190
Of course.

644
00:25:39,150 --> 00:25:41,680
But you still need
to get someone's approval.

645
00:25:49,520 --> 00:25:50,920
Are you a little nervous?

646
00:25:51,400 --> 00:25:52,750
No, I'm fine.

647
00:25:52,960 --> 00:25:54,200
Just relax.

648
00:25:56,270 --> 00:25:56,790
Sister.

649
00:25:58,650 --> 00:26:00,310
Alright, everyone, sit down.

650
00:26:00,310 --> 00:26:01,840
No need to get up. Just sit.

651
00:26:02,750 --> 00:26:03,950
Let me introduce you.

652
00:26:04,350 --> 00:26:05,950
This is my sister, Zhen Meng.

653
00:26:06,200 --> 00:26:06,660
Sister,

654
00:26:06,830 --> 00:26:08,030
he is the one I often mention to you,

655
00:26:08,030 --> 00:26:09,510
the very talented director,

656
00:26:09,510 --> 00:26:10,030
Zhou Ke.

657
00:26:10,080 --> 00:26:11,750
Hello, Ms. Zhen Meng. I'm Ke.

658
00:26:11,770 --> 00:26:12,620
Zhou Ke, Ke.

659
00:26:14,110 --> 00:26:14,730
Whatever.

660
00:26:14,880 --> 00:26:15,640
It's not important.

661
00:26:15,640 --> 00:26:16,480
Anyway,

662
00:26:17,070 --> 00:26:18,070
what's the point today?

663
00:26:18,070 --> 00:26:19,240
Today, I

664
00:26:20,270 --> 00:26:21,360
invited everyone here.

665
00:26:21,360 --> 00:26:22,560
Let me introduce you.

666
00:26:22,640 --> 00:26:23,240
Listen up.

667
00:26:24,270 --> 00:26:25,030
This

668
00:26:25,400 --> 00:26:28,730
is the director of photography
for "Goodbye, Li Qingzhao."

669
00:26:29,160 --> 00:26:30,560
It's an honor to meet you.

670
00:26:30,590 --> 00:26:31,350
This...

671
00:26:32,510 --> 00:26:34,920
is the lighting director for "Afanti 2."

672
00:26:35,920 --> 00:26:37,070
Hello, nice to meet you.

673
00:26:37,070 --> 00:26:38,200
This one is amazing.

674
00:26:38,310 --> 00:26:39,480
This great producer

675
00:26:39,480 --> 00:26:41,750
spotted "Jinzha 2" at a glance

676
00:26:42,310 --> 00:26:44,770
and created a myth
in the Chinese box office.

677
00:26:45,350 --> 00:26:46,200
Oh my god.

678
00:26:46,200 --> 00:26:47,480
I've heard so much about you.

679
00:26:47,480 --> 00:26:48,160
It's such an honor

680
00:26:48,160 --> 00:26:49,030
to meet you all.

681
00:26:49,270 --> 00:26:50,160
Those movies are all...

682
00:26:50,160 --> 00:26:51,750
You... you...

683
00:26:51,920 --> 00:26:53,580
I read the stuff you handed me.

684
00:26:54,030 --> 00:26:54,750
It's quite interesting.

685
00:26:54,750 --> 00:26:55,350
Thank you.

686
00:26:55,510 --> 00:26:57,170
I showed this to the experts,

687
00:26:57,310 --> 00:26:59,440
and they didn't really like it either.

688
00:27:00,200 --> 00:27:01,460
But it doesn't matter.

689
00:27:01,680 --> 00:27:02,920
None of this matters.

690
00:27:03,550 --> 00:27:05,590
Because I don't understand it either.

691
00:27:05,590 --> 00:27:07,120
But my sister wants to do it,

692
00:27:07,170 --> 00:27:08,100
so I support her.

693
00:27:09,480 --> 00:27:10,930
I've invited the top,

694
00:27:11,430 --> 00:27:13,670
most outstanding professionals

695
00:27:13,700 --> 00:27:15,200
in China's film and TV industry

696
00:27:15,200 --> 00:27:16,160
to be here today.

697
00:27:16,350 --> 00:27:17,010
Except you.

698
00:27:18,750 --> 00:27:19,720
I don't know what my sister

699
00:27:19,720 --> 00:27:21,310
sees in you.

700
00:27:22,400 --> 00:27:24,240
In my own industry,

701
00:27:24,750 --> 00:27:26,200
I've never been second.

702
00:27:26,400 --> 00:27:27,730
If you're going to do it,

703
00:27:27,960 --> 00:27:29,440
you have to be the best.

704
00:27:33,110 --> 00:27:34,720
Don't worry, Ms. Zhen Meng.

705
00:27:35,310 --> 00:27:36,340
I will do my best.

706
00:27:37,120 --> 00:27:37,780
This works.

707
00:27:51,090 --> 00:27:53,120
Thanks for your hard work, everyone.

708
00:27:53,120 --> 00:27:55,510
The most important part of this scene

709
00:27:56,030 --> 00:27:57,160
is the musical part.

710
00:27:57,400 --> 00:27:58,730
Its format is quite new,

711
00:27:58,770 --> 00:28:00,830
and the male and female roles
are reversed.

712
00:28:00,830 --> 00:28:02,550
Zhen Ni, come on.

713
00:28:03,920 --> 00:28:05,590
When the time comes, she will...

714
00:28:05,590 --> 00:28:07,680
I'll basically be in the girl's position.

715
00:28:07,680 --> 00:28:09,640
Then the two of us will do this,

716
00:28:09,640 --> 00:28:10,590
turn slightly,

717
00:28:10,590 --> 00:28:12,310
and then turn back,

718
00:28:12,550 --> 00:28:14,240
and I'll be in her arms.

719
00:28:16,510 --> 00:28:17,640
Yes, just like that.

720
00:28:18,230 --> 00:28:19,070
Ke is here.

721
00:28:24,200 --> 00:28:24,880
Zhen?

722
00:28:32,590 --> 00:28:33,720
Look, this is the main thing.

723
00:28:33,720 --> 00:28:35,180
This looks like me, right?

724
00:28:35,400 --> 00:28:36,800
It really looks like you.

725
00:28:38,240 --> 00:28:40,130
What's Zhou Ke's background?

726
00:28:40,720 --> 00:28:42,830
Is he Ms. Zhen's boyfriend?

727
00:28:43,310 --> 00:28:44,270
What boyfriend?

728
00:28:44,550 --> 00:28:46,400
They've already met the parents.

729
00:28:46,400 --> 00:28:47,070
Met the parents?

730
00:28:47,070 --> 00:28:47,720
Really?

731
00:28:48,140 --> 00:28:49,340
Why would I lie to you?

732
00:28:49,940 --> 00:28:50,900
I also heard

733
00:28:51,160 --> 00:28:53,440
he used to be an extra in Shudian.

734
00:28:53,550 --> 00:28:54,270
An extra?

735
00:28:55,400 --> 00:28:57,350
And now he's a director.

736
00:28:58,730 --> 00:29:00,050
He's so lucky.

737
00:29:00,080 --> 00:29:01,130
I'm so jealous.

738
00:29:01,640 --> 00:29:03,030
Right? He's lucky.

739
00:29:03,960 --> 00:29:05,110
If Ms. Zhen liked me,

740
00:29:05,400 --> 00:29:07,240
I'd be willing to marry into her family.

741
00:29:07,240 --> 00:29:08,640
What are you laughing at?

742
00:29:08,680 --> 00:29:09,880
For someone like you,

743
00:29:10,110 --> 00:29:12,070
she wouldn't even want you
to marry into her family.

744
00:29:12,070 --> 00:29:13,070
Stop chatting, you two.

745
00:29:13,070 --> 00:29:14,070
Are the GIFs done?

746
00:29:14,270 --> 00:29:15,050
Coming, coming.

747
00:29:15,050 --> 00:29:15,510
Coming.

748
00:29:45,260 --> 00:29:45,910
Zhen.

749
00:29:57,880 --> 00:29:59,480
I'd like a steamed egg with king crab

750
00:29:59,480 --> 00:30:02,010
and a charcoal-grilled
golden crucian carp.

751
00:30:02,720 --> 00:30:04,350
And also that M12 Wagyu beef,

752
00:30:04,350 --> 00:30:04,960
medium.

753
00:30:05,160 --> 00:30:05,490
Okay.

754
00:30:06,520 --> 00:30:07,470
How would you like your steak done?

755
00:30:07,470 --> 00:30:08,470
Medium is fine.

756
00:30:09,110 --> 00:30:10,310
What about you, Zhen?

757
00:30:11,880 --> 00:30:13,200
Anything is fine.

758
00:30:13,220 --> 00:30:13,960
I'll have what you're having.

759
00:30:13,960 --> 00:30:14,920
Okay, all the same.

760
00:30:14,920 --> 00:30:16,320
Let me take another look.

761
00:30:17,310 --> 00:30:18,770
Isn't this too expensive?

762
00:30:18,960 --> 00:30:19,560
It's fine.

763
00:30:20,660 --> 00:30:21,070
So generous.

764
00:30:21,070 --> 00:30:22,240
And the fish balls you like.

765
00:30:22,240 --> 00:30:23,570
I'll order some for you.

766
00:30:24,140 --> 00:30:25,400
Okay, let's have some.

767
00:30:26,770 --> 00:30:27,380
Zhen,

768
00:30:27,410 --> 00:30:29,270
see if there's anything you like.

769
00:30:31,530 --> 00:30:33,340
[Signature Fish Ball, ¥ 628]

770
00:30:37,310 --> 00:30:38,310
Anything is fine.

771
00:30:38,830 --> 00:30:39,680
I'll have what you're having.

772
00:30:39,680 --> 00:30:40,590
I-I'm fine.

773
00:30:41,240 --> 00:30:42,500
Let's place the order.

774
00:30:42,750 --> 00:30:44,280
Okay, please wait a moment.

775
00:30:44,830 --> 00:30:46,560
-Come on, take one.
-Thank you.

776
00:30:56,350 --> 00:30:57,350
Zhen, Zhen.

777
00:30:57,350 --> 00:30:58,110
Well, look.

778
00:31:01,880 --> 00:31:02,640
Pour some water onto it.

779
00:31:02,640 --> 00:31:04,440
Put it here. I'll pour it for you.

780
00:31:05,030 --> 00:31:06,160
I'll pour it for you.

781
00:31:06,540 --> 00:31:07,470
Wipe your hands.

782
00:31:11,900 --> 00:31:12,790
It's quite sweet

783
00:31:12,790 --> 00:31:13,720
and smells good.

784
00:31:15,030 --> 00:31:16,590
Let me formally introduce you again.

785
00:31:16,590 --> 00:31:18,270
This is the one who invested in my movie,

786
00:31:18,270 --> 00:31:18,960
Ms. Zhen Ni.

787
00:31:19,240 --> 00:31:20,310
This is the cultural tourism head

788
00:31:20,310 --> 00:31:21,310
of Shapu Village,

789
00:31:21,350 --> 00:31:21,720
Zhen.

790
00:31:22,030 --> 00:31:22,680
Hello.

791
00:31:23,960 --> 00:31:24,760
Hello. Hello.

792
00:31:24,880 --> 00:31:25,590
Have a seat.

793
00:31:29,830 --> 00:31:31,830
We haven't been in touch for so long.

794
00:31:31,830 --> 00:31:32,760
How is my sister?

795
00:31:32,990 --> 00:31:34,080
Your sister is doing great.

796
00:31:34,080 --> 00:31:36,210
She's doing well with Chen Junnan too.

797
00:31:37,440 --> 00:31:38,500
What about Jiahao?

798
00:31:38,680 --> 00:31:40,590
Jiahao is busy running for chief recently.

799
00:31:40,590 --> 00:31:41,720
He's doing well too.

800
00:31:43,390 --> 00:31:45,050
And how are you and Bingqiang?

801
00:31:49,640 --> 00:31:51,640
Bingqiang is doing well too.

802
00:31:54,420 --> 00:31:56,680
That's good, as long as everyone is well.

803
00:31:59,790 --> 00:32:01,720
Zhen, you came back this time to...

804
00:32:03,990 --> 00:32:05,120
To ask you for money.

805
00:32:08,720 --> 00:32:09,350
Well,

806
00:32:09,400 --> 00:32:10,070
before I left,

807
00:32:10,070 --> 00:32:11,830
didn't I ask my sister to tell you?

808
00:32:11,830 --> 00:32:13,560
I'll pay you back slowly. Soon.

809
00:32:14,110 --> 00:32:15,170
How much do you owe?

810
00:32:16,680 --> 00:32:17,680
Eighty thousand.

811
00:32:18,480 --> 00:32:19,540
I'll pay it for him.

812
00:32:19,790 --> 00:32:20,590
No, no, no need.

813
00:32:20,590 --> 00:32:21,110
This is my own business.

814
00:32:21,110 --> 00:32:21,960
I'll pay it myself.

815
00:32:21,960 --> 00:32:24,030
It's fine. What's our relationship?

816
00:32:26,520 --> 00:32:27,430
No need.

817
00:32:27,550 --> 00:32:29,270
I can pay her back.

818
00:32:29,400 --> 00:32:30,510
We'll get paid soon.

819
00:32:30,510 --> 00:32:32,370
I'll pay her back then. Very soon.

820
00:32:36,670 --> 00:32:37,840
Very soon.

821
00:32:37,870 --> 00:32:39,870
I'll be able to pay it back very soon.

822
00:32:39,960 --> 00:32:41,510
I'm just kidding.

823
00:32:41,590 --> 00:32:42,750
I came here to deliver fish balls

824
00:32:42,750 --> 00:32:44,160
and happened to see you.

825
00:32:44,790 --> 00:32:45,440
No rush,

826
00:32:45,440 --> 00:32:46,510
no rush for the money.

827
00:32:46,510 --> 00:32:47,720
I was just saying, Zhen.

828
00:32:47,720 --> 00:32:48,550
She and I have a good relationship.

829
00:32:48,550 --> 00:32:50,310
Yeah, I'm in no rush.

830
00:32:51,240 --> 00:32:52,400
Here, the appetizers are here.

831
00:32:52,400 --> 00:32:53,480
Eat up.

832
00:32:53,580 --> 00:32:54,180
Thank you.

833
00:32:58,100 --> 00:32:59,560
Eat up. You guys eat first.

834
00:32:59,970 --> 00:33:01,500
Hold it with your left hand.

835
00:33:17,700 --> 00:33:19,190
Where are you going later?

836
00:33:18,020 --> 00:33:23,900
♪ Memories are like endless rain ♪

837
00:33:20,200 --> 00:33:20,720
Home.

838
00:33:23,070 --> 00:33:24,550
Then we'll take you to the station.

839
00:33:24,490 --> 00:33:28,650
♪ I hold my umbrella,
but still get soaked ♪

840
00:33:24,960 --> 00:33:25,480
Zhou Ke.

841
00:33:26,160 --> 00:33:27,160
We're meeting the investor later.

842
00:33:27,160 --> 00:33:29,030
He doesn't like people being late.

843
00:33:29,030 --> 00:33:31,900
♪ Loving you without telling the world ♪

844
00:33:30,830 --> 00:33:31,290
Well...

845
00:33:32,190 --> 00:33:34,900
♪ It's funny, actually ♪

846
00:33:32,680 --> 00:33:33,400
It's fine.

847
00:33:33,400 --> 00:33:34,680
I can go back by myself.

848
00:33:35,330 --> 00:33:38,550
♪ At least at night,
I have these thoughts ♪

849
00:33:38,560 --> 00:33:41,680
♪ To keep me company in the silence ♪

850
00:33:43,270 --> 00:33:49,410
♪ I was just a little short on luck ♪

851
00:33:43,790 --> 00:33:44,590
